 to helga schmidt  she has helped shape the eas from  the ground up and she has been  the authority on eu foreign policy  for well well over a decade  from javier solana to joseph burrell  her advice has been precious  and her negotiating skills are an  inspiration to manny legendary  so she does not need luck in the next  chapter of her career  but i know you will join me in wishing  her  all the best so as she will  no doubt tell you wherever you are  posted  this is a moment for action  it is a moment to reach out and make  clear that europe is ready to engage  engage for recovery engage for  resilience  engage for reforms indeed  europe is ready long live europe  thank you  you
 

